<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>You're Invited — MicroIntern</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: #0f172a; color: #e2e8f0; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }
    .card { background: #1e293b; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1d4ed8, #4f46e5); padding: 40px 32px; text-align: center; }
    .logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
    .logo span { color: #93c5fd; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; margin-top: 8px; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); font-size: 12px; color: #bfdbfe; }
    .body { padding: 40px 32px; text-align: center; }
    h1 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #f1f5f9; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .role-box { background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin: 0 auto 24px; max-width: 400px; text-align: center; }
    .role-box .title { font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .role-box .role-name { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #60a5fa; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 14px 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #4f46e5); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .expiry { background: #1a1a2e; border: 1px solid #7c3aed30; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 13px; color: #a78bfa; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .footer { padding: 24px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #1e293b; text-align: center; }
    .footer p { font-size: 12px; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .footer a { color: #60a5fa; text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="logo">Micro<span>Intern</span></div>
        <div class="badge">Management Portal</div>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <h1>You've been invited! 🎉</h1>
        <p>You have been invited to join the <strong>MicroIntern Management Portal</strong>{{#if companyName}} for <strong>{{companyName}}</strong>{{/if}}.</p>
        <div class="role-box">
          <div class="title">Assigned Role</div>
          <div class="role-name">{{role}}</div>
        </div>
        <p>Click the button below to accept your invitation, set up your password, and access your workspace.</p>
        <a href="{{invitationUrl}}" class="btn">Accept Invitation</a>
        <div class="expiry">⏰ This invitation link expires in <strong>7 days</strong></div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p>© {{year}} MicroIntern Inc. · <a href="{{frontendUrl}}">microintern.io</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
